{"id":5281,"date":"2020-11-16T11:27:57","date_gmt":"2020-11-16T10:27:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5281"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:02:43","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:02:43","slug":"moncommissariat-fr","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/moncommissariat-fr\/","title":{"rendered":"moncommissariat.fr"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Pr\u00e9-plainte, signalements, conseils : la police nationale vous guide au quotidien dans toutes vos d\u00e9marches en ligne.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p>Vous \u00eates victime ou t\u00e9moin,<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>de violences,<\/li>\n<li>d&rsquo;un vol,<\/li>\n<li>d&rsquo;escroqueries,<\/li>\n<li>de fraude \u00e0 la carte bancaire,<\/li>\n<li>de d\u00e9gradations volontaires,<\/li>\n<li>de tout autre d\u00e9lits,<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>vous pouvez \u00e0 tout moment signaler une fait sur <a href=\"http:\/\/moncommissariat.fr\">moncommissariat.fr<br \/>\n<\/a>Un policier vous r\u00e9pond via le tchat 7J\/7 de 8h \u00e0 20h.<br \/>\nEn cas d&rsquo;urgence, composez le <strong>17<\/strong> ou le <strong>112<\/strong>, disponible 7J\/7, 24H\/24.<br \/>\n&#8212;<br \/>\nCOVID-19 : <strong>0\u00a0800\u00a0130\u00a0000<\/strong> est le num\u00e9ro vert \u00e0 composer pour toute question relative au coronavirus (SARS-CoV-2, Covid-19)\u00a0 24\u00a0heures sur\u00a024 et 7\u00a0jours sur 7.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/ob_0d0248_infographie-des-teleservices-page-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-image-5509 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/ob_0d0248_infographie-des-teleservices-page-1.jpg\" width=\"439\" height=\"754\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/ob_0d0248_infographie-des-teleservices-page-1.jpg 439w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/ob_0d0248_infographie-des-teleservic